{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "WEBSTER1833",
  "book_code": "PSA",
  "chapter": 34,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "A Psalm",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of David, when he changed his behavior before Abimelech; who drove him away, and he departed. I will bless the LORD at all times: his praise ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " continually ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "be",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in my mouth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "My soul shall make her boast in the LORD: the humble shall hear ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " and be glad.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O magnify the LORD with me, and let us exalt his name together.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I sought the LORD, and he heard me, and delivered me from all my fears.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "They looked to him, and were lightened: and their faces were not ashamed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "This poor man cried, and the LORD heard ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "him",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and saved him out of all his troubles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The angel of the LORD encampeth around them that fear him, and delivereth them.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O taste and see that the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " good: blessed ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " trusteth in him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "O fear the LORD, ye his saints: for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "there is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " no want to them that fear him.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The young lions do lack, and suffer hunger: but they that seek the LORD shall not want any good ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "thing",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ".",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Come, ye children, hearken to me; I will teach you the fear of the LORD.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What man ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is he that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " desireth life, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "and",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " loveth ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "many",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " days, that he may see good?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Keep thy tongue from evil, and thy lips from speaking guile.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Depart from evil, and do good; seek peace, and pursue it.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The eyes of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " upon the righteous, and his ears ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are open",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " to their cry.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The face of the LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " against them that do evil, to cut off the remembrance of them from the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The righteous",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " cry, and the LORD heareth, and delivereth them out of all their troubles.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " nigh to them that are of a broken heart; and saveth such as are of a contrite spirit.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Many ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "are",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " the afflictions of the righteous: but the LORD delivereth him out of them all.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "He keepeth all his bones: not one of them is broken.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Evil shall slay the wicked: and they that hate the righteous shall be desolate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "PSA.34.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "WEBSTER1833:PSA.34.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "The LORD redeemeth the soul of his servants: and none of them that trust in him shall be desolate.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
